                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "HHvH9",
                      "name": "simNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 仿真必须复用真实决策链路（同一套 engine），不能另写一套判定逻辑，否则验证无意义。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "qAG58",
                      "name": "simNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 链路需单步可见：校验 → 特征 → 名单 → 规则 → 仲裁，每步标注耗时与结论（E18.trace）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "fZVV4",
                      "name": "simNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 模拟事件流必须支持固定随机种子，保证同一场景每次演示结果完全一致。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "2yniK",
                      "name": "simNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 批量回放用于评估误伤：需同时给出「命中数 / 未命中数 / 与预期不符数」。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "xXulK",
                      "name": "simNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 用例可保存复用（E17.sim_cases），演示时直接载入，不现场手输 JSON。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
